  <description>Fully transparent, non-shadowing inverted terrain ceiling collision target for lidar returns in the generated image cave world. Uses the same deterministic triangular surface as the floor mirrored about nominal bottom z 2.19 m, thickness 0.04 m, lower surface z range 2.140-2.280 m.</description>
</model>
